Actually, STM32F1 GPIO is a little different from the others STM32 platform. There is no PUPDR register to configure the pull-up/down when INPUT mode is selected, it rather depends on the ODR register value as described in the Table 20.  Thus, to maintain the driver compatibility with the rest of STM32 platforms, the LL_GPIO_SetPinPull() is kept and used to set the PULL in the ODR register.

